      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUNSWICK BOY (6) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (21.70) at this track over 380m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Likely to feature again. BEEP (1) led all the way last time out to score by 1.3 lengths (21.86) at this track in a Grade 5 over 380m. Leading player again. ANTI VENOM (2) was well fancied last time on the strength of a win two back but could only manage sixth (22.07) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from seven starts. In the mix. LOCHINVAR DUDE (7) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
